## Node 2: destination. Delivers the bundle to a bpsink on ipn:2.1, which
## generates a delivery CRS back to the bundle's reportTo (ipn:1.0).
## Starts with a high aggregate limit and a long (1 hour) timeout so the CRS
## stays pending; the test then lowers the timeout at runtime and expects
## bpclock to flush the pending CRS (verifying runtime configurability).
1
a scheme ipn 'ipnfw' 'ipnadminep'
a endpoint ipn:2.0 x
a endpoint ipn:2.1 x
a protocol udp 1400 100
a induct udp 127.0.0.1:4652 udpcli
a outduct udp 127.0.0.1:4651 udpclo
m custodymode orangebook
m srmode compressed
m cbraggr 100 100 3600
r 'ipnadmin node.ipnrc'
s
